event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_08b08e948bf93068016acbb48d06dc8196ac3f6f3f09d5d79c","output_index":0,"sequence_number":81,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing SSR Solutions**\n\nI need to implement straightforward server-side rendering (SSR) to fix the loading announcement issue with atomic navigation. I want to add helper shared tasks and ensure route transactional matching. For testing, I should either create tests in the same directory or reuse existing helpers to make it easier. Appending tests to the existing structure seems like the most straightforward option, which should help in keeping things organized."}

